{\pard \ql \f0 \fs24 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Visual metronome. Pass-through; put on a track or master and open the JSFX window. Flashes on every selected beat division (1/8 ... 6 beats), with a selectable decay curve. The first beat of a bar can use its own color and brightness (bar length from the time signature at the playback position).\par}
}

